                                  "startIndex": 30579,
                                  "endIndex": 30777,
                                  "textRun": {
                                    "content": "Mei Hua Huoxiang Zhengqi contains patchouli, perilla leaf, angelica dahurica root, atractylodes, tangerine peel, pinellia, magnolia bark, poria, platycodon, licorice, areca peel, jujube and ginger. ",
